Add "Sticky Events", as per [MSC4354](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/4354), including the `sticky_duration_ms` query parameter in `PUT /rooms/{roomId}/send/{eventType}/{txnId}`, the `sticky_duration_ms` body property in `PUT /rooms/{roomId}/delayed_event/{eventType}/{txnId}`, the `sticky` section for joined rooms in `/sync` responses and the `unsigned.sticky_duration_remaining_ms` property on message events.
